   110	What distinguishes now: per-frame efficiency curves (above) support 1's shape; nothing yet separates 1 from 3.
   111	
   112	### D. Intended generality
   113	Ragged-K grouped computation: band-split audio models (BS-RoFormer, Mel-Band RoFormer variants, multi-band front-ends), multi-resolution heads, per-group projections with unequal input widths — distinct from the ragged-M grouped-GEMM setting of MoE (MegaBlocks) that the literature covers. Invariants: crossover position is a function of (waste factor, per-launch floor, peak); it disappears when widths are equal (waste 1.0: batched always wins) or when a grouped ragged-K GEMM exists on the target (torch 2.8 gates `_grouped_mm` to compute capability 9.0; sm120 has none). A second checkpoint with the same 60-band layout is not new architecture; a different layout (BS-RoFormer's 62 bands, different dispersion) is the informative change.
