177. **MAJOR — [RESEARCH_DIRECTIONS.md:16](/home/muhit/ms/sm120-nulltest/RESEARCH_DIRECTIONS.md:16), percentages at lines 36 and 151.** Session-3 pre-casting removes **0.7508 ms** of casts: **0.8532→0.1024 ms**, with 60 casts remaining. It does not remove 0.85 ms. Consequently, consumer excess is approximately **46.9%** of removed cast time there and **43.6%** in session 4. At 8 s the respective fractions are **6.6% and 14.1%**, outside the stated 5–10% range. **Minimal fix:** use net removed cast time and correct the percentages.

